@dialogue 1
@characters Cast "forward"
[start]
// @id expressions.happy
Cast.Guide: Welcome!
@expression happy
// @id expressions.default
Cast.Guide: My default portrait returns here.
// @id expressions.none
Cast.Captain: I have no default portrait.
// @id expressions.end
: Goodbye. (end)
[talking]
// @id expressions.talking
Cast.Guide: Let me explain. (end)
@expression talking
[worried]
// @id expressions.worried
Cast.Captain: Watch out! (end)
@expression worried
